!                                                                                                   
! This test calculates the energy and dipole moment                                                 
! of the water molecule at different levels of theory.                                              
!                                                                                                   
! WARNING : TESTING PURPOSE ONLY                                                                    
! We use only LL-type integrals : results are not reliable !                                        
!                                                                                                   
**DIRAC                                                                                             
.TITLE                                                                                              
Water molecule. Restricted kinetic balance. Energies, dipole moment.                                
.WAVE F                                                                                             
.PROPER                                                                                             
.4INDEX                                                                                             
**HAMILTONIAN                                                                                       
.INTFLG                                                                                             
1 0 0 0                                                                                             
**WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                                                    
.SCF                                                                                                
.RELCCSD                                                                                            
*SCF                                                                                                
.EVCCNV                                                                                             
1.0E-8                                                                                              
**PROPERTIES                                                                                        
.DIPOLE                                                                                             
**MOLTRA                                                                                            
.ACTIVE                                                                                             
energy -1.0 2.0 0.2                                                                                 
**RELCCSD                                                                                           
.TIMING                                                                                             
.GRADIENT                                                                                           
*CCFOPR                                                                                             
.MP2G                                                                                               
.RELAXED                                                                                            
*END OF                                                                                             


